  "game_facts": [
    "Story: the player is a teenager whose parents turn out to be intergalactic criminals and are taken away, leaving the player with their curio Blue (starter).",
    "Rarity by stars: 1 Common, 2 Rare, 3 Epic, 4 Legendary, 5 Mythic.",
    "Level cap 40 (2015). Per wiki editors: evolution at level 10 (evo1) and level 25 (evo2); '40-S/A/B/C' are rank upgrades at level 40.",
    "Battle mana costs are small (0-2) and cooldowns are 0-2 turns (Ampaca skill notes).",
    "Defeat: when every curio in the party is at 0 health; returns to the map with no experience or loot.",
    "Arcade (Plinko): one ball costs 5 friend tokens; drops include 1,000 coins, 1 PvP ticket or a rare curio.",
    "Curios were obtained mainly by DNA (shard) farming, PvP rewards and the premium shop.",
    "Curio stats could be browsed in the shop (talk page, 2016).",
    "A community Google Sheets curio database existed; its link is truncated in the wiki (https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets...vvhqUtxzZCi2bQ).",
    "Original image CDN: http://5thplanetdawn.insnw.net/pets_live/assets/images/{pets|abilities|abilities/thumbnail|currency/icon}/<File>.png - e.g. pets/Fox.png (Blue), abilities/Air_Attack_1.png.",
    "Battle HUD (2015 screenshot): 5x speed, Log, Defend, Quit buttons; defeat tip 'Refer a Friend for unique rewards!'."
  ]
}
